---
// The "support iRaceDeck" block on the homepage and the Download page (#1299):
// the lead line, the Buy Me a Coffee button, and a quieter line naming the
// iRaceDeck Supporter membership. The wording and the links live here and in
// `data/support.ts` only, so the two pages cannot drift.
//
// The button is Buy Me a Coffee's own image inside a plain link, not their
// widget script: no third-party script runs for it, and the link's target is
// ours to set. The image is drawn by Buy Me a Coffee on each request and shows
// the current number of supporters beside the text. `width` / `height` are its
// own size, so the page does not shift when it loads.
import { MEMBERSHIP_URL, SUPPORT_BUTTON_IMAGE_URL, SUPPORT_URL } from "../data/support";
---

<div class="support-section">
  <p>iRaceDeck is free — servers and Red Bull aren't. Any support is genuinely appreciated.</p>
  <a class="support-button" href={SUPPORT_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
    <img src={SUPPORT_BUTTON_IMAGE_URL} alt="Support iRaceDeck on Buy Me a Coffee" width="253" height="50" />
  </a>
  <p class="support-membership">
    Or become an <a href={MEMBERSHIP_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener">iRaceDeck Supporter</a> for a monthly amount and get the Supporter role on Discord.
  </p>
</div>
